sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as 3rd Party Client UI
    participant MW as Middleware API
    participant DB as Middleware Database
    participant SMS as SMS/Email Dispatch

    Client->>MW: POST /api/v1/onboarding/otp/send (ProspectID)
    MW->>DB: Verify Lead exists & Address Feasible
    MW->>DB: Generate OTP hash, expiry & save
    MW->>SMS: Dispatch OTP
    MW-->>Client: OTP Dispatched Successfully

    Client->>MW: POST /api/v1/onboarding/otp/validate (OTP, ProspectID)
    MW->>DB: Retrieve OTP & compare hashes, verify expiry
    alt OTP Invalid/Expired
        MW-->>Client: Error (Invalid/Expired OTP)
    else OTP Valid
        MW->>DB: Check onboarding_master for current_step
        alt Existing Prospect (Stopped in middle)
            DB-->>MW: Return step (e.g. STEP_7_PLAN_SELECTED) & saved state
            MW-->>Client: Success (Status: RESUME, RedirectTo: Step 8, Data: PlanInfo)
        else New Prospect
            DB-->>MW: No previous steps completed
            MW->>DB: Update step to STEP_3_OTP_VALIDATED
            MW-->>Client: Success (Status: NEW, RedirectTo: Step 4)
        end
    end
